[[2,63,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the steering wheel in the centred\nposition with the wheels straight.</p><p>Proceed with the removal <a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a> .</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Closely follow the safety regulations\nestablished for this operation.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the interconnection\ncontrol unit.</p><p>2. Undo the nut (2a) and remove steering wheel (2b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If necessary, use a suitable rubber\nhammer.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004345.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,2,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Refit steering wheel (1a) in its seat so that references (1b)\nstamped on the steering wheel and steering column are aligned.</p><p>2. Tighten the fixing nuts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>STEERING WHEEL</p></td><td><p>M16</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>5.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Connect the electrical connection to the interconnection control\nunit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004346.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,2,"<p>Proceed with the refitting <a href=\"#/3025611\">5580C18</a> .</p>"]]